Add validation within the `createProposal` function's action loop to prevent actions from targeting the plugin itself or the `LockManager`.

```solidity
for (uint256 i; i < _actions.length;) {
    if (_actions[i].to == address(this) || _actions[i].to == address(lockManager)) {
        revert InvalidTarget();
    }
    proposal_.actions.push(_actions[i]);
    unchecked {
        ++i;
    }
}
```

ground_truth.fix_description:
Do not permit checkpointer to be disabled (bit 6 unset) if chained signature is used. Revert in this case with custom error. Example fix in BaseSig.sol:
if (signatureFlag & 0x40 == 0) {
    revert MissingCheckpointer();
}

